          <subFactors xsi:type="dssmmDiffMM:DiffCompositeFactor" FactorID="195122" Name="General Ledger" Descr="General ledger keeps centralized charts of accounts and corporate financial balances. It supports all aspects of the business accounting process. In this module, financial accounting transactions are posted, processed, summarized, and reported. It maintains a complete audit trail of transactions and enables individual business units to view their financial information, while parent companies can roll up all business subsidiaries and view the consolidated information." GW="0.013889" LW="0.111111" Hierarchy="1.1" MasterFactorID="195122" diff_kind_Right="DELETE"/>
