            <subFactors xsi:type="dssmmDiffMM:DiffLeafFactor" FactorID="197487" Name="Provide ability to block series of numbers" Descr="Imagine a block as a group or batch, one might ask, &quot;Can we group some items for chosen reasons?&quot; An artificial grouping of items or events in bill of material (BOM) format may be used to facilitate master scheduling and material planning. It may include the historical average of demand expressed as a percentage of total demand for all options within a feature or for a specific end item within a product family and is used as the quantity per in the planning BOM." GW="4.83E-4" LW="0.027027" Hierarchy="3.7.33" MasterFactorID="197487" diff_kind_Right="DELETE">
