            <subFactors xsi:type="dssmmDiffMM:DiffLeafFactor" FactorID="197987" Name="Option to automatically close a sub-contracted work order upon receipt of associated sub-contracted PO" Descr="Subcontracting/outsourcing : The process of having suppliers provide goods and services that were previously provided internally. Outsourcing involves substitution&#x2014;the replacement of internal capacity and production by that of the supplier. Often, a work order starts in the factory, and then the parts have to be sent to a subcontracting supplier (e.g., for galvanizing), and then they come back to be finished." GW="1.65E-4" LW="0.015873" Hierarchy="5.4.61" MasterFactorID="197987" diff_kind_Right="DELETE">
